cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AstroGen: a lightweight library of generative-model cores for astronomy data"
abstract: >-
  AstroGen is a lightweight library of generative-model cores for astronomy
  data. It provides reusable diffusion and variational implementations
  (DDPM, class-conditional DDPM, VAE, super-resolution and denoising
  diffusion) for images, spectra, and simulation volumes, without owning a
  heavy data-processing stack. Conditioning is a first-class model
  capability: class labels, physical parameters, and observations use a
  consistent interface, and building blocks are shared across 1D spectra,
  2D images, and 3D volumes.
type: software
